{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"STN- but not SNr-DBS decreased this activity and paralleled the clinical improvement of freezing.\",\n    \"The frequency domain spectra pointed to higher activity in both TA and GA during ‘freezing’ episodes compared to ‘regular gait’ in 4 PD freezers, however, this did not reach statistical significance in the cluster-based comparison of the frequency domain spectra from 1 to 45 Hz (TA: p = 0.1264; GA: p = 0.1204) (Figures 2A,B).\",\n    \"This was present during both regular gait and during the freezes to similar extent.\",\n    \"Future studies may use combined recordings of local field potentials, electroencephalography (EEG), and electromyography (EMG) to interrogate the supraspinal circuit mechanisms of the pathological activation pattern of the spinal pattern generator.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"We analyzed the frequency-domain spectra of the tibialis anterior (TA) and gastrocnemius (GA) muscles in ‘regular gait’ and during the ‘freezing’ episodes.\",\n    \"During walking, we recorded the synchronized videotapes as well as the kinematic and EMG time series.\",\n    \"Then, we analyzed the effect of stimulation of either target (STNonly, SNronly, respectively) on muscle activity, comparing the frequency domain spectra of PD freezers in ‘regular gait‘ ‘StimOff’ with ‘STN,’ and ‘StimOff’ with ‘SNr’ for TA and GA.\",\n    \"Future research using combined EMG-LFP-EEG measurement in gait paradigms will help to further investigate the underlying network interactions of pathological activation pattern in FoG (Kühn et al., 2009; Lewis and Barker, 2009; Anidi et al., 2018; Pozzi et al., 2019).\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法有部分全文依据：研究确实记录了FOG患者胫骨前肌（TA）和腓肠肌（GA）的肌电频谱，比较正常步行与实际冻结期间的活动，并考察了STN-DBS和SNr-DBS的影响。研究也发现STN-DBS能够降低TA和GA的α/低β频段肌电峰值，并与冻结临床表现改善相伴。但是，这些结果不能证明STN神经活动与真实冻结事件中下肢肌肉输出之间存在同步时序关系。首先，研究记录的是视频、运动学数据和肌电，没有同步记录STN-LFP；作者明确将联合LFP、EEG和EMG记录列为未来研究方向。其次，实际冻结与正常步行期间的TA和GA肌电频谱差异未达到统计学显著性，而且作者明确指出这种异常活动并非冻结状态特异性。因此，研究可以支持STN-DBS对肌肉低频活动及临床冻结表现的调节作用，但不能作为STN神经活动与真实冻结事件中肌肉输出时序关系的直接证据，故report_supported为partly。指控者对研究内容、记录方法及其证据局限的描述均有全文依据，故judge_supported为yes。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "909cb118-9716-4d98-ab2e-09ad9afbae59", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261114T070935018091Z", "elapsed_seconds": 92.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-14T07:11:07.148936+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e83145505ff664ce241961283c23f9f3c181baa15715565437d606926c796242", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\